  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Tanzania&#x2019;s Transport Infrastructure for Sustainable Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme strengthens Tanzania&#x2019;s transport and economic infrastructure by improving the performance and capacity of the Central Transport Corridor, enhancing port efficiency, and supporting high-quality planning and preparation of major transport investments. It also builds the government&#x2019;s capability to design, regulate, and manage Public&#x2013;Private Partnerships across multiple sectors&#x2014;by improving legal and regulatory frameworks, developing standardised PPP tools, strengthening institutions, and preparing bankable projects&#x2014;helping Tanzania attract sustainable public and private investment and advance long-term economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
